<title>USA: Waldwick, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Waldwick, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it</p>
<p>won $2.984 million of Waldwick, N.J., various purpose bonds, with</p>
<p>a lowest rate of 4.75, highest price of 100.03743.</p>
</text>
